The "inputs" property is also an object. It requires a single property "parrec", which is an object with a "type" property set to "parrec". This suggests that the SciTran PAR/REC MR Classifier requires a PAR (Parallel Audio-Record) file as input. The "rec" property is optional and has the same structure as "parrec", but it is not required.

