- The `navigation` property provides a resource representing navigation targets. It has two properties: `resource` and `interval`. The `resource` property specifies the name of the navigation resource, and the `interval` property specifies the interval of navigation targets to provide. The interval can be "years", "months", "weeks" or "days".

