This JSON object represents a taxonomy of potential vulnerabilities with suggested technical priority ratings. It contains metadata about the taxonomy and an array of vulnerability rating taxonomy entries (VRTs) or their parents. The VRTs are categorized as categories, subcategories, or variants, and each has a unique ID, name, and priority rating (1-5). The taxonomy also allows for hierarchical relationships between VRTs, where a parent can have multiple children.

