  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#",
  "title": "Event source template",
  "type": "object",
  "description": "Event source templates.",
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "description": "Unique identifier given by the server",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "key": {
      "description": "Unique key generated by the server to be used in events.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "name": {
      "description": "A name to identify the event source template",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "public": {
      "description": "Make the event source template available to everybody.",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "organizationId": {
      "description": "The organization that offer the event source template.",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "configuration": {
      "description": "Providing a schema aims to help the WUI for configuration.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "schema": {
          "description": "A valid JSON Schema.",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "url": {
          "description": "The configuration URL.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "token": {
          "description": "JSON Web Token to be authenticated when contacting the configuration URL.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "schema",
        "url"
      ]
    },
    "configurationUi": {
      "description": "Provide the configuration for the dynamic UI.",
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "schemaForm": {
          "description": "Valid form schema accordingly to: http://schemaform.io",
          "type": "array"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "id",
    "key",
    "name",
    "public",
    "organizationId"
  ]
}

output:
Iată o instanță JSON care respectă schema dată:

```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "key": "my_event_source_template",
  "name": "My Event Source Template",
  "public": true,
  "organizationId": 123,
  "configuration": {
    "schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "username": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "password": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "url": "https://example.com/config",
    "token": "my_secret_token"
  },
  "configurationUi": {
    "schemaForm": [
      {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Username",
        "name": "username",
        "placeholder": "Enter your username"
      },
      {
        "type": "string",
        "title": "Password",
        "name": "password",
        "placeholder": "Enter your password"
      }
    ]
  }
```

Această instanță JSON include toate câmpurile necesare specificate în schema, cu tipurile de date și descrierile corespunzătoare. Câmpul `configuration` include un schema validă și un URL, iar câmpul `configurationUi` include un schemaForm validă pentru a ajuta la crearea unei interfețe dinamice pentru utilizatori

